  "version": "1",
  "description": "Fixed constructed deck pool for Forge training. Train lists are the opponents sampled during arena_only episodes. Holdout lists are never sampled for training; policy evaluation uses them so the measured matchups are disjoint decklists. Every list is an official Wizards Challenger Deck product (60-card mainboard plus 15-card sideboard). Sideboards are kept in the Arena export and are not sent to Forge. Pioneer Challenger Decks are Pioneer-legal and therefore Arena Explorer-legal. The 2021 and 2022 Standard Challenger Decks were Arena Standard products and remain Arena Historic-legal. MTGJSON legalities.historic was Legal for every card on 2026-10-16; Pioneer products were also legalities.pioneer Legal.",
